{"id":"20260830T075239.547811735Z-4925b637","time":"2026-08-30T07:52:39.547811735Z","session_id":"session-20260830T072521.605271812Z","task_id":"task-1788074721605515483","source":"reviewer","kind":"output","summary":"{\"decision\":\"revise\",\"summary\":\"The implementation appears to rebind production downstream state to the post-validation capture, but the required engine-level proof is missing. Sensei preflight was thin: “coverage_insufficient: no direct anchors and no indexed files,” so the supplied pass audit cannot substitute for exercising the actual workflow path.\",\"instructions\":\"In internal/workflow/postvalidation_test.go, add a regression that drives runCandidate through a real formatting mutation, audit/review acceptance, and minting. Assert the review binding/packet tree and digest are the formatter-produced capture, mint succeeds before any subsequent mutation, and mint refuses after a later mutation. The test must fail if runCandidate stops assigning capture,diff = reviewed,reviewed.Diff.\",\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"f1\",\"severity\":\"blocking\",\"claim\":\"The new tests prove the hand-assembled validate → capture → noteReviewDelivered → mint sequence proves the production candidate loop binds the post-validation state.\",\"reference\":\"internal/workflow/postvalidation_test.go; production binding is in internal/workflow/engine.go runCandidate\",\"reason\":\"Neither new test invokes runCandidate, its review packet construction, audit path, or the new capture,diff reassignment. Both manually install the post-validation tree into the receipt, so they remain green if the production downstream binding is removed or if the reviewer receives the old tree. This does not prove the architect-required end-to-end identity behavior.\",\"correction\":\"Add an engine-loop regression using a formatter that rewrites candidate content and a controlled accepted audit/review response. Verify the actual review binding carries the post-validation diff/tree/path set, then mint succeeds unchanged and refuses after a later worktree mutation.\",\"proof_gap\":\"The supplied go test evidence proves the current tests pass, not that runCandidate routes the verified post-validation capture to audit, review, receipt, decision, and mint.\"}]}","payload":{"stream":"stderr"}}
