{"id":"20260830T075514.806698630Z-4082c768","time":"2026-08-30T07:55:14.80669863Z","session_id":"session-20260830T072521.605271812Z","task_id":"task-1788074721605515483","source":"claude","kind":"output","summary":"{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01P7VXgDLDzd2moHUcxAJMtY\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"443:type taskContext struct {\\n444-\\tTask            string\\n445-\\tConversation    string\\n446-\\tWorkspaceStatus string\\n447-\\tPreflight       string\\n448-\\tRationale       string\\n449-\\tSteps           []string\\n450-\\tDomain          string\\n451-\\t// Mode is the plan's declaration of whether it changes the repository.\\n452-\\t// See architectureDecision.Mode.\\n453-\\tMode         string\\n454-\\tConsequences string\\n455-\\t// Files are the paths the plan names. The candidate boundary treats them\\n456-\\t// as the change's intended outputs; a binary anywhere else is an artifact.\\n457-\\tFiles      []string\\n458-\\tInvariants []string\\n459-\\t// Prospective is the plan's declared new surfaces. See\\n460-\\t// architectureDecision.ProspectiveSurfaces.\\n461-\\tProspective []ProspectiveSurface\\n462-\\t// PlanSource and PlanDigest say who authored the bound. See PlanSource.\\n463-\\tPlanSource PlanSource\\n464-\\tPlanDigest string\\n465-\\t// Report is the rendered change report, set once the candidate is judged so\\n466-\\t// the pull request body carries the same evidence the architect saw.\\n467-\\tReport string\\n468-\\t// Identity binds this task to the exact base it governs.\\n469-\\tIdentity candidate.Identity\\n470-\\t// EvidenceSnapshot is what the candidate contained at the last audit, kept\\n471-\\t// so a handover states the position rather than describing it.\\n472-\\tEvidenceSnapshot taskstate.Evidence\\n473-}\\n474-\\n475-// intent renders the architect's stated reasoning for the roles downstream.\\n476-func (c taskContext) intent() string {\\n477-\\tvar b strings.Build