{"id":"20260830T075900.066406533Z-ac5b7dd2","time":"2026-08-30T07:59:00.066406533Z","session_id":"session-20260830T072521.605271812Z","task_id":"task-1788074721605515483","source":"claude","kind":"output","summary":"{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01MCTMnEn9cvMfQZhgcFHWEY\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"internal/workflow/engine.go:3303:func reviewPrompt(p roles.IndependentReviewPacket) string {\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3304-\\tif p.Inspection() {\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3305-\\t\\treturn inspectionReviewPrompt(p)\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3306-\\t}\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3307-\\treturn fmt.Sprintf(`You are the architectural reviewer for a Sensei-governed candidate. Do not edit files.\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3308-Decide whether the exact candidate satisfies the architectural plan and the supplied Sensei evidence. Passing tests alone is not architectural proof.\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3309-Return ESCALATE only when a genuine architectural-authority question exists; ordinary defects are REVISE.\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3310-\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3311-You are reviewing independently. You did not write this change, you have not\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3312-been told why its author believes it is right, and you are not being asked to\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3313-agree with anybody. Assume the candidate may be wrong even when the tests are\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3314-green, and attack the diff and its proof: stale evidence, authority bypasses,\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3315-unbound identity, hidden scope expansion, and PASS states that prove less than\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3316-they appear to.\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3317-\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3318-You have Sensei's own MCP tools in this session: awareness_briefing,\\ninternal/workflow/engine.go-3319-awareness_preflight, awareness_impact, awareness_query, awareness_r